  eq("ST.667", "(□ψ, ∇f²)·((8πG/c⁴)T^{μν}, 4πGρ) = (−(1/2)mv² + mc², (1/2)kT² + (1/2)mv²)·(cos θ −sin θ; sin θ cos θ) = (1 0; 0 i)", "complementary relativistic energy rotated by rotation matrix → imaginary axis", ["ROT", "SR", "TRANSPORT"], def() return C((0 - 0.5 * 1e6 + C_LIGHT * C_LIGHT) * cos(pi() / 4) + (0.5 * 1 * 1 + 0.5 * 1e6) * sin(pi() / 4), 0 - (0 - 0.5 * 1e6 + C_LIGHT * C_LIGHT) * sin(pi() / 4) + (0.5 * 1 * 1 + 0.5 * 1e6) * cos(pi() / 4)) end)
